    "第一次打开完整播放器时自动显示一次，用文字和箭头指出各块区域。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows once the first time you open the full player, pointing out each area with text and arrows."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一次打开完整播放器时自动显示一次，用文字和箭头指出各块区域。"
