    "播放、上下曲、进度和音量都在这里；点「音色」还能换成 AI 翻唱。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play, skip, seek and volume are all here; hit Voice to switch to an AI cover."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放、上下曲、进度和音量都在这里；点「音色」还能换成 AI 翻唱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "播放都在底栏": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Playback Lives in the Bottom Bar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放都在底栏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音频文件、整个文件夹、歌词文件都能拖进这个窗口。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio files, whole folders and lyric files can all be dropped onto this window."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音频文件、整个文件夹、歌词文件都能拖进这个窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音乐可以直接拖进来": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drop Music Right In"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音乐可以直接拖进来"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "普通是完整窗口，悬浮是歌词小窗，沉浸是满屏画面，随时可以切回来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Normal is the full window, Floating is a small lyric window, Immersive fills the screen. Switch back anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "普通是完整窗口，悬浮是歌词小窗，沉浸是满屏画面，随时可以切回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三种显示方式": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Three Ways to Show It"
