          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首页、收藏、最近播放、歌单、离线都在这里，设置在最下面。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Home, Favorites, Recently Played, Playlists and Offline are all here; Settings sits at the bottom."
