    "播放、歌词、安全区、多屏记忆与手动定位全部照常；**自动避让不会生效**（系统不提供其他窗口位置），形态只按空间与用户操作变化。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Playback, lyrics, safe areas, multi-display memory and manual positioning all work as usual; **auto-avoid won't work** (the system doesn't share other windows' positions), and forms change only with space and your actions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放、歌词、安全区、多屏记忆与手动定位全部照常；**自动避让不会生效**（系统不提供其他窗口位置），形态只按空间与用户操作变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "让悬浮形态不接收鼠标，方便点到底下的窗口；再按一次恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Makes the floating form ignore the mouse so you can click the window below; press again to restore."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让悬浮形态不接收鼠标，方便点到底下的窗口；再按一次恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按宽松顺序循环：完整 → 迷你 → 胶囊 → 贴边 → 完整。隐藏不在这条链上。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cycles in order: Full → Mini → Capsule → Edge → Full. Hidden isn't part of the cycle."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按宽松顺序循环：完整 → 迷你 → 胶囊 → 贴边 → 完整。隐藏不在这条链上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用户显式隐藏优先于一切自动决策；再按一次回到隐藏前的形态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hiding it yourself overrides all automatic decisions; press again to return to the previous form."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户显式隐藏优先于一切自动决策；再按一次回到隐藏前的形态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
