      }
    },
    "留一点余量再恢复，临界空间不会来回跳。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restores with a little margin so it doesn't flip back and forth at the edge."
