    "会议时隐藏歌名与歌词": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide Song & Lyrics in Meetings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会议时隐藏歌名与歌词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检测到 Zoom / 腾讯会议 / Teams / 飞书 / 钉钉 等进入前台时，把歌名与歌词遮起来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When Zoom, Tencent Meeting, Teams, Feishu, DingTalk and similar apps come to the front, song titles and lyrics are hidden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检测到 Zoom / 腾讯会议 / Teams / 飞书 / 钉钉 等进入前台时，把歌名与歌词遮起来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看当前在前台的是哪个应用，不记录任何会议内容。打开时使用内置的常见会议应用清单。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only checks which app is in front; no meeting content is recorded. Uses a built-in list of common meeting apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只看当前在前台的是哪个应用，不记录任何会议内容。打开时使用内置的常见会议应用清单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "跟随系统语言（简体中文 / English）。应用内不提供单独切换。": {
