        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前实际音质"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是正在播放的歌曲实际拿到的格式与码率。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The format and bitrate the current song actually received."
          }
        },
