    "包含版本、系统、权限、队列数量与存储状态，不含歌词、曲目与文件路径。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Includes version, system, permissions, queue size and storage status — no lyrics, tracks or file paths."
          }
        },
