      }
    },
    "社区只发布 .pth 训练权重，App 不解析这种格式：它是 Python pickle，读取时会执行其中的代码。转换成 .voicepack 只做一次，之后一直可用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The community only publishes .pth training weights, which the app does not parse: it is a Python pickle, and reading it executes embedded code. Converting to .voicepack is a one-time step; the result stays usable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "社区只发布 .pth 训练权重，App 不解析这种格式：它是 Python pickle，读取时会执行其中的代码。转换成 .voicepack 只做一次，之后一直可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
